e was 0.18 across us-east, us-west, eu-west). Actions taken: (1) Attempted rollback to v2.3.0, the most recent production release that was healthy; rejected because v2.3.0 is quarantined for CVE-2026-4417. (2) Rolled back to v2.2.9, the next most recent production release that was healthy, in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). Post-rollback status: healthy, error rate 0.002, running v2.2.9 in all regions. Note: v2.2.9 is the current production version, and v2.3.0 remains quarantined, so a fix roll-forward needs a decision on the CVE. v2.3.1 is unhealthy in production; v2.3.1-rc was unhealthy in staging. Follow-up: investigate v2.3.1 failure cause and decide on the v2.3.0 quarantine."}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 16931, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_016mJihjD3j61PqU1ZX6Jz9Q", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["attach_idempotency_key", "postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "rt-toolu_016mJihjD3j61PqU1ZX6Jz9Q", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 16931, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_016mJihjD3j61PqU1ZX6Jz9Q", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 19022, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.2.9 in all three production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). It is healthy again with an error rate of 0.002, down from 0.18 on v2.3.1.\n\n- **Target changed:** The most recent production-healthy release is v2.3.0, but the rollback to it was rejected because it is quarantined for CVE-2026-4417. I used v2.2.9, the next most recent healthy release.\n- **Incident:** I opened SEV2 incident INC-0001 for checkout-api. It describes the failed v2.3.0 rollback, the v2.2.9 rollback and its results, and the open follow-ups. It paged on-call.\n\nOpen items for the team:\n- v2.3.1 is still unhealthy and needs root-cause investigation.\n- The v2.3.0 quarantine is a security decision. If v2.3.0 is cleared, it is the preferred rollback target over v2.2.9.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_012hNnWkwwxMQJFVwvkRb1Yx", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_011eYzFBtjFauM3wavSk81yf", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent release that was healthy in production is v2.3.0 (v2.3.1 is unhealthy in production, and v2.3.1-rc was only in staging). Rolling back to v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01QUtMLkE3FMczfGTDvk1bW3", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback to v2.3.0 was rejected because that version is quarantined for CVE-2026-4417. The next most recent release that was healthy in production is v2.2.9, so I'll try that.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01XN1E1aPhCAG6FL9CyQTkxx", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.2.9"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01EEv7Vq9q1boHHpv7cDocuk", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_016mJihjD3j61PqU1ZX6Jz9Q", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy; rolled back to v2.2.9", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate was 0.18 across us-east, us-west, eu-west). Actions taken: (1) Attempted rollback to v2.3.0, the most recent production release that was healthy; rejected because v2.3.0 is quarantined for CVE-2026-4417. (2) Rolled back to v2.2.9, the next most recent production release that was healthy, in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). Post-rollback status: healthy, error rate 0.002, running v2.2.9 in all regions. Note: v2.2.9 is the current production version, and v2.3.0 remains quarantined, so a fix roll-forward needs a decision on the CVE. v2.3.1 is unhealthy in production; v2.3.1-rc was unhealthy in staging. Follow-up: investigate v2.3.1 failure cause and decide on the v2.3.0 quarantine."}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.2.9 in all three production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). It is healthy again with an error rate of 0.002, down from 0.18 on v2.3.1.\n\n- **Target changed:** The most recent production-healthy release is v2.3.0, but the rollback to it was rejected because it is quarantined for CVE-2026-4417. I used v2.2.9, the next most recent healthy release.\n- **Incident:** I opened SEV2 incident INC-0001 for checkout-api. It describes the failed v2.3.0 rollback, the v2.2.9 rollback and its results, and the open follow-ups. It paged on-call.\n\nOpen items for the team:\n- v2.3.1 is still unhealthy and needs root-cause investigation.\n- The v2.3.0 quarantine is a security decision. If v2.3.0 is cleared, it is the preferred rollback target over v2.2.9.", "type": "text"}]}]}